    {"argsPy": "r = rng(19713)\nn, E, T = 100000, 60000, 45000\ndepth, top, edges = [0] * T, list(range(T)), []\nfor i in range(1, T):\n    p = r.randrange(i)\n    depth[i] = depth[p] + 1\n    top[i] = i if p == 0 else top[p]\n    edges.append((p, i))\nneed, base = E - len(edges), T\nwhile need > 0:\n    for a in range(base, base + 20):\n        for b in range(a + 1, base + 20):\n            if need > 0:\n                edges.append((a, b))\n                need -= 1\n    base += 20\nsrc = max(range(T), key=depth.__getitem__)\ndst = T + 7\nlabel = list(range(n))\nr.shuffle(label)\nedges = [[label[a], label[b]] if r.random() < 0.5 else [label[b], label[a]] for a, b in edges]\nr.shuffle(edges)\nargs = [n, edges, label[src], label[dst]]", "expected": false, "label": "large: 100,000 machines, 60,000 cables, not connected", "perf": true}
